{'symbol': 'CRM', 'date': '2022-08-17 17:30:00', 'title': 'SALESFORCE POSITIONED AS A LEADER IN GARTNER MAGIC QUADRANT™ FOR DIGITAL COMMERCE FOR SEVENTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO , AUG. 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SALESFORCE (NYSE: CRM), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN CRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN NAMED A LEADER BY GARTNER INC. IN ITS 2022 MAGIC QUADRANT FOR DIGITAL COMMERCE. IT IS THE SEVENTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR THAT SALESFORCE HAS EARNED THE RECOGNITION.'}